  "solution": "Given :\n\n22 − [9 − {6 − (10 − 4 + 3)}] ÷ 2 × 3\n\nBODMAS Rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/833bf95aed1ad9b2103d937814ed938d64f5ca098f7062f9d7bf16f1d7d38879.png] \n\nCalculation :\n\n22 − [9 − (6 − (10 − 4 + 3)}] ÷ 2 × 3\n\n⇒ 22 - [9 - {6 - (13 - 4)}] ÷ 2 × 3\n\n⇒ 22 - [9 - {6 - 9}] ÷ 2 × 3\n\n⇒ 22 - [9 - {-3}] ÷ 2 × 3\n\n⇒ 22 - [9 + 3] ÷ 2 × 3\n\n⇒ 22 - [12] ÷ 2 × 3\n\n⇒22 - 6 × 3\n\n⇒ 22 - 18\n\n⇒ 4\n\n∴ The answer is 4.",
